      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00073",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "写到这里，我浮想联翩。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Writing up to this point, my thoughts began to wander.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00073",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "想起刚才的挥剑之类的行为，自己也觉得可笑，简直太荒唐了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When I thought of things like my sword-swinging just now, even I found myself ridiculous; it was utterly absurd.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00073",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "但是，“是肚子里的怪兽在吃食啊”这句话附在我身上……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But the words, \"It is the monster in my belly eating,\" clung to me...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00073",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "现在约莫九点钟了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is about nine o'clock now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
